This repository is an independently maintained integration project. It does not
claim authorship of Casdoor or imply endorsement by its developers. Casdoor modifications are
distributed as an ordered patch series, with the exact upstream revision and
checksums in upstream.lock.json. Prepared source records every modified path in
integration-provenance.json. Go dependency manifests, the frontend package
manifest and Yarn lockfile contain integration dependency updates. The example
server configuration is derived from upstream and marked as modified.

The ACME integration uses go-acme/lego (MIT); its licence is in licenses/Lego-MIT.txt.
The frontend uses SheetJS Community Edition (Apache-2.0); its licence is in
licenses/SheetJS-Apache-2.0.txt. The image carries the dependency, font, Swagger
and system package notice inventories in /licenses/dependencies. Recovered
license evidence is recorded in licenses/overrides.json. Source archives for
covered MPL Go modules and the installed system packages accompany the image.

This software uses Freetype-Go under the FreeType License, and is based in part
on the work of the FreeType Team (https://www.freetype.org/). The original
FreeType licence, copyright and accompanying notices are retained in the image.

The LDAP message dependency is pinned to its author's MIT release commit.
This changes its licence from the older dependency revision, with identical
non-licence source files. It does not claim authorship of that dependency.
Candidate distribution and stable production acceptance are separate records.
